WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:02.430
Now, ladies and gentlemen,
most of you already know

00:00:02.430 --> 00:00:04.990
that the Democratic Convention
is going on right now

00:00:04.990 --> 00:00:06.700
in Chicago, it's a big deal.

00:00:06.700 --> 00:00:10.870
And Andy and I wanted very much to attend,

00:00:10.870 --> 00:00:13.770
but as you know, we
don't have a lot of time.

00:00:13.770 --> 00:00:16.130
You know, our time is a
very precious commodity.

00:00:16.130 --> 00:00:17.784
Right, Kyle would be sitting here alone.

00:00:17.784 --> 00:00:19.310
Exactly.
If we had gone there.

00:00:19.310 --> 00:00:23.600
Right, exactly so what we
did is we decided to send

00:00:23.600 --> 00:00:27.690
our very own foam rubber
Conan and Andy instead

00:00:27.690 --> 00:00:28.850
'cause they're just as good.

00:00:28.850 --> 00:00:32.210
Now, I've been told we're
still having a couple

00:00:32.210 --> 00:00:34.770
of audio problems with foam rubber Andy,

00:00:34.770 --> 00:00:37.440
but I understand they're
hardly noticeable.

00:00:37.440 --> 00:00:41.550
So here they are, folks, the
foam rubber Conan and Andy

00:00:41.550 --> 00:00:43.273
in Chicago, hiya fellas.

00:00:44.116 --> 00:00:45.630
[Foam Rubber Conan] We're in
between speakers right now,

00:00:45.630 --> 00:00:49.389
but man alive, this is a
lot of fun, huh Andy, huh?

00:00:49.389 --> 00:00:51.496
This is unbelievable.
(Andy moaning)

00:00:51.496 --> 00:00:53.329
We are here, man, woo!

00:00:54.410 --> 00:00:56.733
Right here, I'm on the floor!

00:00:57.680 --> 00:01:00.350
I'm just standing here,
it's a great turnout.

00:01:00.350 --> 00:01:01.840
I mean, there's a lot of people here.

00:01:01.840 --> 00:01:03.440
A lot of 'em involved in politics,

00:01:03.440 --> 00:01:04.940
and I think that's great.

00:01:04.940 --> 00:01:07.580
But we wanna show you some
of the stuff we've seen today

00:01:07.580 --> 00:01:09.870
so we're gonna roll it right now, huh.

00:01:09.870 --> 00:01:12.945
Here we go!
(Andy mumbling)

00:01:12.945 --> 00:01:15.945
(audience laughing)

00:01:16.940 --> 00:01:17.773
What's your name?

00:01:17.773 --> 00:01:19.456
My name's John Olson.

00:01:19.456 --> 00:01:22.350
[Foam Rubber Conan] John
Olson, what do you do, John?

00:01:22.350 --> 00:01:24.360
I sell political memorability here

00:01:24.360 --> 00:01:26.510
for political Americana
and financial innovations,

00:01:26.510 --> 00:01:28.320
the official licensee

00:01:28.320 --> 00:01:31.747
of the Democratic
National Convention 1996.

00:01:31.747 --> 00:01:33.153
[Foam Rubber Conan] Can
you say that one more time.

00:01:34.254 --> 00:01:35.278
(John stammers)

00:01:35.278 --> 00:01:40.278
(patriotic instrumental music)
(audience laughing)

00:01:41.851 --> 00:01:43.646
How you doing, James?

00:01:43.646 --> 00:01:46.729
We love you, James.
How y'all doing?

00:01:48.958 --> 00:01:50.570
[Foam Rubber Conan] Well,
that was our first interview.

00:01:50.570 --> 00:01:51.403
(audience laughing)

00:01:51.403 --> 00:01:52.950
If you want to see it again, here it is.

00:01:52.950 --> 00:01:54.513
How you doing, James?

00:01:55.520 --> 00:01:58.103
We love you, James.
How y'all doing?

00:01:59.155 --> 00:02:00.538
(audience laughing)

00:02:00.538 --> 00:02:02.860
[Foam Rubber Conan] Conan,
the bathroom situation here

00:02:02.860 --> 00:02:05.130
at the convention is pretty grim.

00:02:05.130 --> 00:02:06.450
In the hall itself
you're gonna have to wait

00:02:06.450 --> 00:02:09.220
about a half hour in line, but thank God

00:02:09.220 --> 00:02:11.948
for the good people at Portable John.

00:02:11.948 --> 00:02:12.781
(audience laughing)

00:02:12.781 --> 00:02:13.907
They've got these all over the place.

00:02:13.907 --> 00:02:18.907
(Andy moaning)
(audience laughing)

00:02:19.050 --> 00:02:20.657
Took you long enough, Andy.

00:02:20.657 --> 00:02:24.030
(Andy mumbling)

00:02:24.030 --> 00:02:26.410
Let's go, move it alone, people.

00:02:26.410 --> 00:02:28.930
All right everybody, that's it for tonight

00:02:28.930 --> 00:02:30.722
for Andy and I from the convention.

00:02:30.722 --> 00:02:32.470
We'll see you tomorrow night, all right.

00:02:32.470 --> 00:02:35.100
We're having a lot of fun
'cause it's a convention, woo!

00:02:35.100 --> 00:02:37.785
Ow, come on man, what are you doing?

00:02:37.785 --> 00:02:40.150
Woo, hello America!
(Andy grunts)

00:02:40.150 --> 00:02:41.820
It's our second night
here at the convention.

00:02:41.820 --> 00:02:43.470
Things are pretty much wrapping up now,

00:02:43.470 --> 00:02:46.054
but we're sticking around
having a party, woo!

00:02:46.054 --> 00:02:48.220
Andy's had a couple too many.

00:02:48.220 --> 00:02:51.310
We tried to talk to some
people like some Democrats,

00:02:51.310 --> 00:02:55.288
but people don't seem to be
interested, you know, right?

00:02:55.288 --> 00:02:57.820
(Andy grunting)
Yeah, exactly.

00:02:57.820 --> 00:03:02.820
I mean, yeah, wait, come
on man, play off, be cool.

00:03:02.836 --> 00:03:04.004
Anyway, we're gonna
show you some highlights

00:03:04.004 --> 00:03:07.824
from today at the convention
and so take a look.

00:03:07.824 --> 00:03:10.908
(cheers) All right, Convention '96!

00:03:10.908 --> 00:03:12.351
(audience applauding)
Come on, man.

00:03:12.351 --> 00:03:14.976
(upbeat rock music)

00:03:14.976 --> 00:03:19.226
(audience laughing and applauding)

00:03:20.733 --> 00:03:21.952
Andy wants to ask you a question.

00:03:21.952 --> 00:03:22.914
What do you want to ask me?

00:03:22.914 --> 00:03:25.628
(Andy mumbling)

00:03:25.628 --> 00:03:27.003
What?

00:03:27.003 --> 00:03:29.902
(Andy mumbling)

00:03:29.902 --> 00:03:31.923
I don't understand what he's saying.

00:03:31.923 --> 00:03:35.630
(Andy mumbling)
What?

00:03:35.630 --> 00:03:38.630
(upbeat rock music)

00:03:43.448 --> 00:03:44.823
[Foam Rubber Conan] I had
no idea it was illegal?

00:03:44.823 --> 00:03:46.710
You just put 'em up there
up against the wall.

00:03:46.710 --> 00:03:49.060
You watch it there, pink
stuff, you watch it!

00:03:49.060 --> 00:03:49.897
I'm watching you!

00:03:49.897 --> 00:03:50.730
[Foam Rubber Conan] All right, all right,

00:03:50.730 --> 00:03:52.745
take it easy, huh.
Come on, hey now!

00:03:52.745 --> 00:03:56.202
[Foam Rubber Conan] Hey, hey, I saw that!

00:03:56.202 --> 00:03:58.820
I got five bucks on me and
I'm itching to spend it.

00:03:58.820 --> 00:04:01.090
Let's go drink, Andy, woo!

00:04:01.090 --> 00:04:04.492
Chug, chug, chug, chug, chug,
chug, chug, chug, chug, chug,

00:04:04.492 --> 00:04:07.933
chug, chug, chug, chug,
chug, chug, chug, yes!

00:04:09.422 --> 00:04:12.642
(Andy groaning)
(audience laughing)

00:04:12.642 --> 00:04:13.550
I think we lost Andy.

00:04:13.550 --> 00:04:16.389
Like, 20 minutes we was in the sky box

00:04:16.389 --> 00:04:18.060
and we were drinking and buying

00:04:18.060 --> 00:04:19.900
and then I lost him 'cause the door shut.

00:04:19.900 --> 00:04:22.470
I couldn't get back in
'cause it was locked.

00:04:22.470 --> 00:04:23.900
But I'm gonna go back, now, man

00:04:23.900 --> 00:04:25.890
'cause I know he's back at the hotel.

00:04:25.890 --> 00:04:29.361
We're gonna party some
more at the Convention '96!

00:04:29.361 --> 00:04:32.361
(upbeat rock music)

00:04:37.902 --> 00:04:39.647
This is what the convention's all about.

00:04:39.647 --> 00:04:41.210
That's right, honey.

00:04:41.210 --> 00:04:44.210
(upbeat rock music)

00:04:46.787 --> 00:04:49.954
(audience applauding)

00:04:53.845 --> 00:04:58.845
(audience laughing)
(audience applauding)

00:04:59.445 --> 00:05:01.452
(audience cheering and applauding)

00:05:01.452 --> 00:05:05.577
Why, why, Andy?
I don't know.

00:05:08.867 --> 00:05:13.610
And I think also the question

00:05:13.610 --> 00:05:15.010
that's on all America's mind,

00:05:15.010 --> 00:05:17.260
why is your caricature
a pink bear? (laughs)

00:05:17.260 --> 00:05:20.540
I never knew that myself.

00:05:20.540 --> 00:05:22.627
My brother Luke called me
this morning and was like,

00:05:22.627 --> 00:05:25.857
"I don't understand why
Andy is a pink bear."

